00:06:51.336 --> 00:06:59.136
<v Slow>ピッチャーの織田選手の一番速いボールは、時速何キロですか。

00:06:59.935 --> 00:07:03.295
<v Host>One hundred fifty-seven kilometers per hour.

00:07:03.896 --> 00:07:09.271
<v Slow>決勝の相手は、どこのチームですか。

00:07:10.072 --> 00:07:14.151
<v Host>South Korea — the team Japan lost to the day before.

00:07:14.752 --> 00:07:24.279
<v Host>That's all for today. The final against South Korea is today — a big chance for Japan to get even after that close loss. See you next time.

